WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.700 --> 00:00:09.124
Petals and Thorns is a bluffing game for three to six players. Everybody has a stack of little discs, and one of them is a thorn.

2
00:00:09.824 --> 00:00:16.211
To start, you each place one disc face down. A petal, or your thorn. Nobody else knows which.

3
00:00:16.361 --> 00:00:21.146
Then, in turn, you either add another disc to your stack, or you start the bidding.

4
00:00:21.846 --> 00:00:26.556
The bid is a promise. I can flip this many discs, and find only petals.

5
00:00:26.706 --> 00:00:31.435
Everyone else can raise it, or pass. Whoever bids highest has to back it up.

6
00:00:32.135 --> 00:00:39.957
You flip your own discs first, and then you start on your rivals' stacks, top disc first. Find only petals and you score a point.

7
00:00:40.107 --> 00:00:42.353
Hit the thorn and you lose a disc.

8
00:00:43.053 --> 00:00:52.959
The classic trick is hiding your thorn at the bottom of a big stack so you look safe. Or making a tiny bid with a thorn on top, just to throw people off.

9
00:00:53.109 --> 00:00:57.311
First to win two challenges, or the last player with discs, takes it.
